---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Refund Policy | Where Horses Run"
  description="Refund policy for optional tips made to Where Horses Run."
>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">Payments</p>
    <h1 id="page-title">Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="hero__summary">This policy applies if optional tip payments are enabled in the future.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-grid" aria-label="Refund policy">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Voluntary tips</h2>
      <p>Tips are voluntary payments made after free information or content has already been provided. No physical item, paid membership, betting service, or future performance is purchased by making a tip.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Refund requests</h2>
      <p>If you believe a payment was duplicated, made in error, or otherwise requires review, contact us through the Contact page. Requests are reviewed individually and handled in accordance with applicable law and the payment processor's rules.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Processing</h2>
      <p>If a refund is approved, it will normally be returned through the original payment method. Processing time can vary by payment provider and financial institution.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Disputes</h2>
      <p>Please contact us first if you do not recognize a payment or believe there is a payment problem so that it can be investigated promptly.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
